# The single pin. Consumed as BOTH the knock container tag and the git ref the
# example policies are checked out at, so the binary and the policies can never
# disagree — the visitor verifies the exact file the docs site publishes.
#
# 0.9.2 carries both fixes the showcase needs: path-namespaced registry support
# (GHCR wants the owner as the first path segment) and skipping the referrers-
# fallback `sha256-<hex>` tags GHCR forces clients to write, which an earlier
# release mistook for images on the second reconcile.
#
# renovate: datasource=docker depName=ghcr.io/trivoallan/knock
KNOCK_VERSION=0.9.2
